WEBVTT

54:03.350 --> 54:04.768
(HE TUTS)

54:04.893 --> 54:06.686
That is the grip.

54:06.812 --> 54:09.773
You are not holding a battle-axe.
You are holding...

54:09.898 --> 54:11.233
A needle.

54:11.358 --> 54:13.985
Ahhh. (CHUCKLES)

54:14.861 --> 54:16.530
Just so.

54:16.655 --> 54:19.407
Now we will begin the dance.

54:19.533 --> 54:20.951
Remember, child,

54:21.076 --> 54:23.912
this is not the dance of the Westeros
we are learning...

54:24.037 --> 54:27.833
The knight's dance,
hacking and hammering.

54:28.667 --> 54:31.628
This is the Braavos dance...
